<title>UK: Argenta Nederland sets 2.0 bln Luf five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argenta Nederland sets 2.0 bln Luf five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTA NEDERLAND AV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ARGENTA BANQUE D'EPARGNE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.10	MATURITY    20.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  100</p>
<p>PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
